the knowledge base deontic_example_history includes:

the text of "the L4 source deontic-example.l4" is at "sources/deontic-example.l4".

something happens on day a day if
    a party does deliver goods with description a description on day the day.

something happens on day a day if
    the clock reaches day the day.

something happens on day a day if
    a party does pay invoice with amount an amount on day the day.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    something happens on day the day.

a party does something on day a day if
    the party does deliver goods with description a description on day the day.

a party does something on day a day if
    the party does pay invoice with amount an amount on day the day.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    the contract simple delivery obligation starts on day the day.

the obligation that simple delivery obligation obliges seller to deliver goods with description "standard package" by day a due day D as its first obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract simple delivery obligation starts on day N
    and D = N + 14.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    the contract delivery within days starts on day the day with deadline a deadline.

the obligation that delivery within days obliges seller to deliver goods with description "standard package" by day a due day D as its first obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract delivery within days starts on day N with deadline a deadline M
    and D = N + M.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    the contract sale contract starts on day the day with price a price.

the obligation that sale contract obliges seller to deliver goods with description "merchandise" by day a due day D as its first obligation given price a price starts on day a day N if
    the contract sale contract starts on day N with price the price
    and D = N + 14.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    the contract mutual obligations starts on day the day.

the obligation that the first joint part of mutual obligations obliges seller to deliver goods with description "item A" by day a due day D as its first obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract mutual obligations starts on day N
    and D = N + 14
    and a thing T = N + 30.

the obligation that the second joint part of mutual obligations obliges buyer to pay invoice with amount 1000 by day a due day D as its second obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract mutual obligations starts on day N
    and a thing T = N + 14
    and D = N + 30.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    the contract flexible delivery starts on day the day.

the obligation that the first alternative part of flexible delivery obliges seller to deliver goods with description "express shipping" by day a due day D as its first obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract flexible delivery starts on day N
    and D = N + 7
    and a thing T = N + 14.

the obligation that the second alternative part of flexible delivery obliges seller to deliver goods with description "standard shipping" by day a due day D as its second obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract flexible delivery starts on day N
    and a thing T = N + 7
    and D = N + 14.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    the contract conditional delivery starts on day the day with urgent an urgent.

the obligation that conditional delivery obliges seller to deliver goods with description "urgent delivery" by day a due day D as its first obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract conditional delivery starts on day N with urgent an urgent
    and the urgent is equal to true
    and D = N + 3.

the obligation that conditional delivery obliges seller to deliver goods with description "standard delivery" by day a due day D as its second obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract conditional delivery starts on day N with urgent an urgent
    and it is not the case that the urgent is equal to true
    and D = N + 14.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    the contract minimum payment contract starts on day the day.

the obligation that minimum payment contract obliges buyer to pay invoice by day a due day D as its first obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract minimum payment contract starts on day N
    and D = N + 30.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    the contract exact payment required starts on day the day with required amount a required amount.

the obligation that exact payment required obliges buyer to pay invoice with amount an amount by day a due day D as its first obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract exact payment required starts on day N with required amount the amount
    and D = N + 30.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    the contract create order contract starts on day the day with order type an order type and price a price.

the obligation that create order contract obliges seller to deliver goods with description "express order" by day a due day D as its first obligation given price a price starts on day a day N if
    the contract create order contract starts on day N with order type an order type and price the price
    and the order type is equal to "express"
